 **Edge Cases and Pitfalls:**
-*   **Memory Constraints:** Standard feed-forward methods fail at 2K+ resolutions due to memory (e.g., NoPoSplat requires >61 GB at 1024x576). LGTM uses <30 GB [S1, unofficial].
